      <Description>2 wide x 2 high x 5 long large-grid turbine/compressor. One lower-cell duplex H/C socket on a shared network with the reactor and coolers. Turbines connect as parallel branches. Use the mirrored version for an opposite-side socket. The built-in compressor takes grid power for startup and cooldown; the reactor supplies CO2 internally.</Description>
